    description:
      '#20241116 #ConferenceDay 📅 🎟️ The Conference Day for PyCon HK 2024 on November 16 is still open for registration. Visit: https://pyconhk2024.eventbrite.hk . 📜 For the event',
    content:
      '<h4 class="wp-block-heading">#20241116 #ConferenceDay 📅</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>🎟️ The Conference Day for PyCon HK 2024 on November 16 is still open for registration. Visit: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://pyconhk2024.eventbrite.hk/?form=MG0AV3">https://pyconhk2024.eventbrite.hk</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>📜 For the event schedule, you can check the official website or the following link: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://pretalx.com/pyconhk2024/schedule/?form=MG0AV3">https://pretalx.com/pyconhk2024/schedule/</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🚶‍♂️ For directions to the City University of Hong Kong, visit: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="/2024/2024-access-guide-conference-day/">https://pycon.hk/access-guide-conference-day/</a> or <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://www.cityu.edu.hk/about/campus/getting-to-cityu">https://www.cityu.edu.hk/about/campus/getting-to-cityu</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>📧 Participants need to present their entry QR Code to access the Yeung Kin Man Academic Building at City University of Hong Kong on Conference Day. Some QR Codes have already been emailed to participants who registered via Eventbrite. If you have registered and have not received your QR Code by the evening of the 15th, please DM us.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>⏳ Participants can start checking in and collecting their badges from 9:15am. Due to the high number of attendees, please be patient.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🎁 Sponsor and community booths will be located at LT 7-9. Take this opportunity to network and collect stamps at each booth to redeem fantastic gifts, quantity is limited and first come first served. Please refer to the announcements on the day for more details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🍴 The nearest dining option is City Express, located on the 5th floor of the Amenities Building. menu: <a href="https://csd.order.place/order/store/112870/mode/prekiosk(modal:order/dialog/search-item)?onpremise=true&amp;back=true&amp;form=MG0AV3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Link</a>. You can also explore other dining options at CityU here: <a href="https://www.cityu.edu.hk/directories/catering?form=MG0AV3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.cityu.edu.hk/directories/catering</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🍽️ After the conference, join us for the Party Dinner at Ban Heung Lau Chinese &amp; Western Restaurant (Shop 204-205 &amp; 210-213, Podium, Nam Shan Shopping Centre, Nam Shan Estate, Shek Kip Mei). Register in advance: <a href="https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/16-nov-pycon-hong-kong-party-dinner-tickets-1080153200299?form=MG0AV3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/16-nov-pycon-hong-kong-party-dinner-tickets-1080153200299</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">#20241117 #SprintDay 🚀</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>🎫 Participants for Sprint Day on November 17 need to register for the Sprint Day Ticket on Eventbrite. Details: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="/2024/important-notice-about-sprint-day/?form=MG0AV3">https://pycon.hk/2024/important-notice-about-sprint-day/</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🚶‍♀️ For directions to the venue, visit: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="/2024/2024-access-guide-development-sprint-day/">https://pycon.hk/access-guide-development-sprint-day/</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>📜 For the event schedule, visit: <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="/2024/2024-sprint/">https://pycon.hk/sprint/</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🍻 After Sprint Day, join us for Happy Hour Beer Time at Day N Nite Cafe &amp; Bar (G/F, Green View Court, 2-4 Observatory Court, Tsim Sha Tsui). Register in advance: <a href="https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/17-nov-happy-hour-beer-time-pycon-hong-kong-tickets-1080160612469?form=MG0AV3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/17-nov-happy-hour-beer-time-pycon-hong-kong-tickets-1080160612469</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">PyCon HK 2024 行前通知</h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">20241116 #會議日 📅</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>🎟️11月16日 PyCon HK 2024 會議日仍然接受登記，網址： https://pyconhk2024.eventbrite.hk/</p>\n\n\n\n<p>📜活動時程可於官方網站或以下網站參看：<br><a href="https://pretalx.com/pyconhk2024/schedule/">https://pretalx.com/pyconhk2024/schedule/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>🚶‍♂️如何到達會場香港城市大學可參考以下網址：<br><a href="/2024/2024-access-guide-conference-day/">https://pycon.hk/access-guide-conference-day/<br></a><a href="https://www.cityu.edu.hk/about/campus/getting-to-cityu">https://www.cityu.edu.hk/about/campus/getting-to-cityu</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>📧會議日參加者需憑當日入場 QR Code 進入香港城市大學楊建文學術樓，部份 QR Code 已預先透過電郵發送予經已在 Eventbrite 登記的參加者。假如你已登記並於 15 日晚上還未收到 QR Code，請 DM 與我們聯絡。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>⏳參加者可於 9:15am 開始登記領取入場證。由於參與人數眾多，敬請耐心等待。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🎁贊助商及社群攤位分佈於 LT 7-9，歡迎把握機會參與交流。憑入場證於各個攤位集齊印花可換取精美禮品，數量有限，送完即止。換領詳情請留意大會當日公告。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>🍴與會場最接近的食肆為城大食坊，位於城市大學康樂樓5樓。<br>城大食坊菜單：<br><a href="https://csd.order.place/order/store/112870/mode/prekiosk(modal:order/dialog/search-item)?onpremise=true&amp;back=true">https://csd.order.place/order/store/112870/mode/prekiosk(modal:order/dialog/search-item)?onpremise=true&amp;back=true<br></a>你也可以參考以下網址了解城市大學其他餐廳位置：<br><a href="https://www.cityu.edu.hk/directories/catering">https://www.cityu.edu.hk/directories/catering</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>🍽️會議完結後大會將移師品香樓中西風味餐廳（九龍塘九龍仔南山邨南豐樓2樓平台204-205室）舉辦 Party Dinner，歡迎預先登記： <a href="https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/16-nov-pycon-hong-kong-party-dinner-tickets-1080153200299">https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/16-nov-pycon-hong-kong-party-dinner-tickets-1080153200299</a></p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">20241117 #SprintDay 🚀</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>🎫11月17日 Sprint Day 參加者需於 Eventbrite 成功登記 Sprint Day Ticket 方可參與活動，詳情請參閱 <a href="/2024/important-notice-about-sprint-day/">https://pycon.hk/2024/important-notice-about-sprint-day/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>🚶‍♀️如何到達會場可參考以下網址：<br><a href="/2024/2024-access-guide-development-sprint-day/">https://pycon.hk/access-guide-development-sprint-day/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>📜活動時程請參考以下網址：<br><a href="/2024/2024-sprint/">https://pycon.hk/sprint/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>🍻Sprint Day 完結後大會將於 Day N Nite Cafe &amp; Bar (G/F, Green View Court, 2-4 Observatory Court, Tsim Sha Tsui) 舉辦 Happy Hour Beer time，歡迎預先登記： <a href="https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/17-nov-happy-hour-beer-time-pycon-hong-kong-tickets-1080160612469">https://www.eventbrite.hk/e/17-nov-happy-hour-beer-time-pycon-hong-kong-tickets-1080160612469</a></p>',
