    slug: '2024-access-guide-development-sprint-day',
    url: '/2024/2024-access-guide-development-sprint-day/',
    title: 'Access Guide – Development Sprint Day – PyCon HK 2024',
    dateTime: '2024-10-18T08:40:54+00:00',
    description:
      'Development Sprint Day 17th November (Sun), 2024 Google Map AWS Experience Space: GenAI Pop-up 17/F, Tower 535, 535 Jaffe Road, Causeway Bay, Hong Kong Tower 535 is easily',
    content:
      '<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Development Sprint Day<br>17th November (Sun), 2024<br><br><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/pwkhbnRZecFt1g3Q9" title="Google Map">Google Map</a><br>AWS Experience Space: GenAI Pop-up<br>17/F, Tower 535, 535 Jaffe Road, Causeway Bay, Hong Kong</h6>\n\n\n\n<p>Tower 535 is easily accessible by MTR, with only 2-minute walking distance from MTR Causeway Station (exit D1).</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="926" height="794" src="/legacy-wp/2024/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Access-Guide-Development-Sprint-Day.png" alt="Access Guide - Development Sprint Day" class="wp-image-3621" srcset="/legacy-wp/2024/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Access-Guide-Development-Sprint-Day.png 926w, /legacy-wp/2024/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Access-Guide-Development-Sprint-Day-300x257.png 300w, /legacy-wp/2024/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Access-Guide-Development-Sprint-Day-768x659.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 926px) 100vw, 926px"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>',
